{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "h",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Adding a field to BoardTask\n\nThe order matters. Step 4 is the one\npeople miss \u2014 and it fails **silently**.",
      "x": -560,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 \u00b7 Models/BoardTask.swift\nAdd the property\n+ a default in `init`",
      "x": -560,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 \u00b7 BoardTask+RemoteCoding\n`Key.newField`\nencode in `remoteValue`",
      "x": -560,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 \u00b7 Decode\n`init?(remoteValue:fallbackID:)`\nwith a safe fallback",
      "x": -560,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 \u00b7 \u26a0\ufe0f conflictTiebreakKey\n**Append the new field.**\n\nOtherwise two tasks differing only by it\nproduce equal keys \u2192 the tiebreak stops\nbeing a total order \u2192 devices never converge.",
      "x": -560,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 \u00b7 database.rules.json\nOnly if it needs validation",
      "x": -560,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ui",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Then the UI\n`TaskEditorSheet` \u2014 input\n`TaskCardView` \u2014 display\n`BoardViewModel` \u2014 thread it through",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "test",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## And a test\nRound-trip encode/decode\n+ a tiebreak symmetry case\n\n`swift-testing`: `@Test` / `#expect`",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "invf",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "02 Invariants.md",
      "x": -80,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
